# The Box tool on the sketch example: two clicks draw B1 by two corners;
# M takes the centre and corner method, a click places the centre, and the
# width 0.4 and the height 0.2 typed place the corner of B2, its centre a
# helper point that symmetric() keeps in the middle; Esc quits the tool.
open docs/instances/sketch-basic.json
wait 16
action tool.box
wait 2
click L 708 339
click L 789 291
wait 2
key M
click L 748 266
move 789 250 3
wait 2
text "0.4"
key Tab
text "0.2"
key Enter
wait 2
key Escape
wait 2
